Marguerite, the in situ relative humidity results for the Phase 1 guestroom=
 floors are complete. Twenty two probes were placed per ASTM F2170, three p=
er floor plus spares at the corridor slabs, drilled to 40 percent depth, se=
aled and read at 72 hours.<br />
<br />
Readings ranged from 88 to 91 percent relative humidity across floors 3 thr=
ough 8. The specification threshold in Section 09 05 61 is 85 percent, so n=
othing on the Phase 1 slabs currently qualifies for flooring without the mi=
tigation system.<br />
<br />
We would expect some drying over the next two months but not eight points o=
f it. This is a post tensioned slab with a curing compound still on the sur=
face in several bays.